{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27136","headline":"送忍禅师归庐岳 · 周贺","name":"送忍禅师归庐岳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浪匝湓城岳壁青，白头僧去扫禅扃。\n龛灯度雪补残衲，山日上轩看旧经。\n泉水带冰寒溜涩，薜萝新雨曙烟腥。\n已知身事非吾道，甘卧荒斋竹满庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}